==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|hús|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*hūsą}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/hʉuːs/|lang=fo}}

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|n|hús|hús}}

# [[building]]
# (''only'' {{g|n-p}}) [[house]] to live in, [[home]], [[dwelling]]
# [[accommodation]], dwelling, [[shelter]]
# [[household]]
# [[family]], people living in one household

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-noun-n11|hús}}

====Synonyms====
* '''building'''
: [[bygningur]]
* '''house'''
: [[bústaður]], [[sethús]]
* '''accomodation'''
: [[tilhald]], [[innivist]]
* '''household'''
: [[húshald]]
* '''people living in one household'''
: [[húski]], [[húsfólk]]

